## Dangerous-goods labeling (GHS vs TDG)

- When asked about transport labels, GHS pictograms, 副危, 分类鉴定, or MSDS Section 2 vs 14: follow Skill `.cursor/skills/dg-ghs-tdg-labeling/SKILL.md` and `knowledge/07-compliance/ghs-tdg-mapping.md`.
- Transport marks follow TDG (classification report + SDS §14), not GHS pictograms alone.

